---
// Bento Grid Éditorial des Services Conciergerie — unilka
---

<section id="services" class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-brand-surface-subtle border-b border-brand-primary-light/60">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-14">
    
    <!-- En-tête de section éditoriale -->
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-6">
      <div class="space-y-3 max-w-2xl">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-primary">
          Notre Gamme d'Intervention
        </span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold text-brand-navy tracking-tight">
          Des prestations calibrées selon votre mode de vie.
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div>
        <a
          href="/services/"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-bold text-brand-primary hover:text-brand-primary-dark transition-colors no-underline group"
        >
          <span>Voir l'ensemble de nos services</span>
          <span class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bento Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 lg:gap-8">
      
      <!-- BENTO 1 : VEDETTE RÉSIDENTIEL (Prend 2 colonnes sur grand écran) -->
      <article class="lg:col-span-2 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-brand-primary-light/90 p-8 sm:p-10 shadow-luxury hover:shadow-luxury-hover transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between group">
        <div class="space-y-6">
          
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-brand-primary-light text-brand-primary text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
              <span>Résidence & Condo de Prestige</span>
            </span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-brand-muted">Fréquence flexible</span>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-3">
            <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-brand-navy group-hover:text-brand-primary transition-colors">
              <a href="/services/nettoyage-residentiel/" class="no-underline text-inherit">
                Nettoyage résidentiel sur-mesure
              </a>
            </h3>
            <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-brand-muted leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
              Maison de ville, appartement contemporain ou grand condo : profitez d'un intérieur étincelant sans sacrifier vos soirées ni vos week-ends. Nos intervenants appliquent des protocoles stricts de propreté.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Inclusions clés en 2 colonnes -->
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 pt-4 border-t border-brand-primary-light/60 text-xs sm:text-sm text-brand-navy">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-brand-primary-light text-brand-primary flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs shrink-0">✓</span>
              <span>Dégraissage et assainissement de la cuisine</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-brand-primary-light text-brand-primary flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs shrink-0">✓</span>
              <span>Détartrage des salles de bain & douches</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-brand-primary-light text-brand-primary flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs shrink-0">✓</span>
              <span>Dépoussiérage méticuleux des surfaces & plinthes</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-brand-primary-light text-brand-primary flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs shrink-0">✓</span>
              <span>Lavage et entretien des sols délicats</span>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

        <div class="pt-8 mt-6 border-t border-brand-primary-light/60 flex items-center justify-between">
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-brand-muted">Grand Montréal & Rive-Sud</span>
          <a
            href="/services/nettoyage-residentiel/"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-bold text-brand-primary hover:text-brand-primary-dark no-underline group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-all"
          >
            <span>Détails de la prestation</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- BENTO 2 : COMMERCIAL & BUREAUX -->
      <article class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-brand-primary-light/90 p-8 shadow-luxury hover:shadow-luxury-hover transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between group">
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-brand-primary-light text-brand-primary text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
              <span>Professionnel</span>
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-3">
            <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-brand-navy group-hover:text-brand-primary transition-colors">
              <a href="/services/nettoyage-commercial/" class="no-underline text-inherit">
                Locaux d'affaires & Bureaux
              </a>
            </h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-brand-muted leading-relaxed">
              Bureaux privés, boutiques, cliniques et commerces. Des espaces soignés pour accueillir vos clients et motiver vos équipes.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-2 pt-2 border-t border-brand-primary-light/60 text-xs text-brand-navy">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">✓ Horaires adaptés hors ouverture</div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">✓ Sanitaires, postes et zones d'accueil</div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">✓ Tarification corporative claire</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-6 mt-6 border-t border-brand-primary-light/60">
          <a href="/services/nettoyage-commercial/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-bold text-brand-primary hover:text-brand-primary-dark no-underline">
            <span>En savoir plus &rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- BENTO 3 : SPÉCIALISÉ & TEXTILES -->
      <article class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-brand-primary-light/90 p-8 shadow-luxury hover:shadow-luxury-hover transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between group">
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-brand-gold-light text-brand-gold text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
              <span>Soin Spécifique</span>
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-3">
            <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-brand-navy group-hover:text-brand-primary transition-colors">
              <a href="/services/nettoyage-specialise/" class="no-underline text-inherit">
                Nettoyage spécialisé & Textiles
              </a>
            </h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-brand-muted leading-relaxed">
              Canapés, matelas, tapis et intérieur de véhicules : injection-extraction en profondeur pour raviver les tissus et éliminer taches et allergènes.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-2 pt-2 border-t border-brand-primary-light/60 text-xs text-brand-navy">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">✓ Détachage et désinfection en profondeur</div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">✓ Évaluation directe par photo</div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">✓ Véhicules, tapis et mobiliers délicats</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-6 mt-6 border-t border-brand-primary-light/60">
          <a href="/services/nettoyage-specialise/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-bold text-brand-primary hover:text-brand-primary-dark no-underline">
            <span>En savoir plus &rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- BENTO 4 : FORMULE RÉCURRENTE SANS ENGAGEMENT (Prend 2 colonnes sur grand écran) -->
      <article class="lg:col-span-2 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-navy to-brand-primary text-white rounded-2xl p-8 sm:p-10 shadow-luxury hover:shadow-luxury-hover transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between group">
        <div class="space-y-6">
          
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-xs text-white text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
              <span>Abonnement & Sérénité</span>
            </span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-white/80">Sans contrat d'engagement</span>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-3">
            <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-white">
              <a href="/services/entretien-regulier/" class="no-underline text-inherit">
                Entretien régulier à forfait fixe
              </a>
            </h3>
            <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-white/80 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
              Chaque semaine, aux deux semaines ou chaque mois. Profitez d'une tarification forfaitaire transparente et de la même équipe dédiée qui connaît vos habitudes et vos exigences.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-3 pt-4 border-t border-white/20 text-xs font-medium text-white/90">
            <div class="p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-xs">1× par semaine</div>
            <div class="p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-xs">Aux 2 semaines</div>
            <div class="p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-xs">Aux 3 semaines</div>
            <div class="p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-xs">1× par mois</div>
          </div>

        </div>

        <div class="pt-8 mt-6 border-t border-white/20 flex items-center justify-between">
          <span class="text-xs text-white/70">Ajustable ou résiliable sans frais</span>
          <a
            href="/services/entretien-regulier/"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-bold text-white bg-white/20 hover:bg-white hover:text-brand-navy px-4 py-2 rounded-md transition-all no-underline"
          >
            <span>Choisir ma fréquence &rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
